# The "this computer and common hardware" profile: what this computer uses
# (localmodconfig) and these, for the parts a user might put in instead. One
# option a line without CONFIG_; m or y after it is a note: a tristate becomes
# a module, a bool is switched on. An option whose dependencies are off stays off.

